mail-client/himalaya:imap - Enable IMAP backend
mail-client/himalaya:maildir - Enable Maildir backend
mail-client/himalaya:smtp - Enable SMTP backend
net-analyzer/snort3:flatbuffers - Use dev-libs/flatbuffers for serialization
net-analyzer/snort3:hyperscan - Use dev-libs/hyperscan for regular expression matching
net-analyzer/snort3:iconv - Enable support for the iconv character set conversion library
net-analyzer/snort3:large-pcap - Enable support for pcaps larger than 2 GB
net-analyzer/snort3:lzma - Support for LZMA (de)compression algorithm
net-analyzer/snort3:tcmalloc - Use the dev-util/google-perftools libraries to replace the malloc() implementation with a possibly faster one
net-analyzer/snort3:tirpc - Use net-libs/libtirpc for RPC
net-analyzer/snort3:tsc - Use timestamp counter register clock (x86 and arm only)
net-analyzer/snort3:unwind - Add support for call stack unwinding and function name resolution
net-analyzer/snort3:uuid - UUID support via sys-apps/util-linux
net-analyzer/telegraf:savedconfig - Build only configured plugins
net-analyzer/telegraf:systemd - Install systemd service file
net-libs/libdaq:af-packet - Build the bundled AFPacket module
net-libs/libdaq:bpf - Build the bundled BPF wrapper module
net-libs/libdaq:divert - Build the bundled Divert module
net-libs/libdaq:dump - Build the bundled Dump module
net-libs/libdaq:fst - Build the bundled FST module
net-libs/libdaq:netmap - Build the bundled netmap module
net-libs/libdaq:nfq - Build the bundled NFQ module
net-libs/libdaq:pcap - Build the bundled PCAP module
net-libs/libdaq:savefile - Build the bundled Savefile module
net-libs/libdaq:trace - Build the bundled Trace module
net-nds/authelia:mysql - Enable MySQL support
net-nds/authelia:postgres - Enable PostgreSQL support
net-nds/authelia:redis - Enable redis support
net-nds/authelia:sqlite - Enable sqlite support
sys-cluster/seaweedfs:fuse - Require sys-fs/fuse for mount support
www-apps/grafana:systemd - Install systemd service file
